'identity_guild_id': '874803913470148649', 'identity_enabled': True, 'badge': '3cd5833282f176c9c62a54bc48957735'}, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': 'f56cd132db2aa4738ee30926002172ef'}], 'mention_roles': [], 'mention_everyone': False, 'id': '1477933317708972083', 'flags': 0, 'embeds': [], 'edited_timestamp': None, 'content': '- **Unbothered confidence (not arrogance):** Comfortable in your own skin, not constantly seeking approval.\n- **Authenticity:** Having tastes/opinions/style that feel genuinely yours, not just copied to fit in.\n- **Social intelligence:** Reading the room, being kind without being a pushover, knowing when to talk and when to listen.\n- **Competence + passion:** Being good at something (or clearly committed to it). Skill is attractive—music, sports, coding, fashion, cars, anything.\n- **Good vibes / low drama:** People often label “cool” those who are fun to be around and don’t create chaos.\n- **Style as expression:** Not necessarily expensive—more like “intentional.” A coherent look, even if simple.\n- **Independence:** Having your own life, goals, and boundaries; not clinging.\n- **Taste/curation:** Knowing what you like (music, memes, places, aesthetics) and sharing it in a way that isn’t try-hard.\n- **Values:** Increasingly, “cool” includes being respectful and fair (and *not* being hateful). In many circles, cruelty is “cringe,” not cool.', 'components': [], 'channel_type': 1, 'channel_id': '1451800030259187802', 'author': {'username': 'Jiggle Bot', 'public_flags': 0, 'primary_guild': None, 'id': '1431829716201115749', 'global_name': None, 'display_name_styles': None, 'discriminator': '1315', 'collectibles': None, 'clan': None, 'bot': True, 'avatar_decoration_data': None, 'avatar': 'a06a7e2e43b01eb8de5558c613cdcc70'}, 'attachments': []}}
